# CopilotKit NPM包发布自动化规则

## 发布流程概述
当用户要求发布npm包时，严格按照以下步骤执行：

### 1. 版本更新规则
- 用户提供目标版本号（如 4.0.3, 4.1.0, 4.10.1等）
- 必须更新所有7个包的版本号：
  - `CopilotKit/packages/react-core/package.json`
  - `CopilotKit/packages/react-ui/package.json` 
  - `CopilotKit/packages/react-textarea/package.json`
  - `CopilotKit/packages/runtime/package.json`
  - `CopilotKit/packages/runtime-client-gql/package.json`
  - `CopilotKit/packages/sdk-js/package.json`
  - `CopilotKit/packages/shared/package.json`

### 2. 依赖关系处理规则
- **构建阶段**：所有内部依赖使用 `workspace:*`
- **发布阶段**：所有内部依赖改为具体版本号
- 内部包依赖关系：
  ```
  react-core 依赖: runtime-client-gql, shared
  react-ui 依赖: react-core, runtime-client-gql, shared  
  react-textarea 依赖: react-core, runtime-client-gql, shared
  runtime 依赖: shared
  runtime-client-gql 依赖: runtime, shared
  sdk-js 依赖: shared
  shared: 无内部依赖
  ```

### 3. 发布命令序列模板
```bash
# 1. 切换到正确目录
cd CopilotKit

# 2. 更新所有包版本号到目标版本 (例如 4.0.3)
# 使用 search_replace 工具更新每个 package.json 的 version 字段

# 3. 安装依赖并构建
pnpm install
pnpm run build

# 4. 将内部依赖从 workspace:* 改为具体版本号
# 使用 search_replace 工具更新所有内部依赖

# 5. 检查npm登录状态
npm whoami

# 6. 按依赖顺序发布包
cd packages/shared && npm publish
cd ../runtime && npm publish  
cd ../runtime-client-gql && npm publish
cd ../react-core && npm publish
cd ../react-ui && npm publish
cd ../react-textarea && npm publish
cd ../sdk-js && npm publish
```

### 4. 发布顺序规则（严格执行）
1. **@freebeatfit/shared** - 基础包，无依赖
2. **@freebeatfit/runtime** - 依赖 shared
3. **@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql** - 依赖 runtime, shared
4. **@freebeatfit/react-core** - 依赖 runtime-client-gql, shared
5. **@freebeatfit/react-ui** - 依赖 react-core, runtime-client-gql, shared
6. **@freebeatfit/react-textarea** - 依赖 react-core, runtime-client-gql, shared  
7. **@freebeatfit/sdk-js** - 依赖 shared

### 5. 错误处理规则

#### GraphQL Schema 错误处理
如果 runtime-client-gql 构建失败（缺少schema文件）：
```bash
cd CopilotKit/packages/runtime
pnpm run generate-graphql-schema
```

#### 版本冲突处理
如果出现版本已存在错误，需要升级到下一个版本号

#### 依赖安装错误处理
```bash
pnpm install --no-frozen-lockfile
```

### 6. 自动化脚本模板

#### 版本号更新脚本
```bash
# 将所有包从当前版本更新到目标版本 {VERSION}
search_replace("  \"version\": \"当前版本\",", "  \"version\": \"{VERSION}\",") 
# 对每个package.json文件执行
```

#### 依赖关系更新脚本  
```bash
# react-core dependencies
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"{VERSION}\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")

# react-ui dependencies  
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/react-core\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/react-core\": \"{VERSION}\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"{VERSION}\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")

# react-textarea dependencies
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/react-core\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/react-core\": \"{VERSION}\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/runtime-client-gql\": \"{VERSION}\",\n    \"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")

# runtime dependencies
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")

# runtime-client-gql dependencies
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/runtime\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/runtime\": \"{VERSION}\",")
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")

# sdk-js dependencies  
search_replace("\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"workspace:*\",", "\"@freebeatfit/shared\": \"{VERSION}\",")
```

### 7. 检查清单
发布前必须确认：
- [ ] 所有包版本号一致
- [ ] 内部依赖关系正确
- [ ] npm已登录
- [ ] 所有包构建成功
- [ ] GraphQL schema文件存在

发布后验证：
- [ ] 所有包都成功发布到npm
- [ ] 可以正常安装新版本包
- [ ] 依赖关系无错误

### 8. 常用调试命令
```bash
# 检查包版本
npm view @freebeatfit/shared versions --json

# 检查依赖关系
npm ls --depth=0

# 重新生成lockfile
rm pnpm-lock.yaml && pnpm install

# 清理构建缓存
pnpm run clean && pnpm run build
```

## 重要提醒
- 发布是不可逆操作，确保版本号正确
- 严格按照依赖顺序发布
- 发布前必须将workspace依赖改为具体版本
- 出现错误时优先查看上述错误处理方案
- 每次发布后都要验证安装是否正常
